 "web": "These barriers land on the same people at once. One child: anemic at two because the iron program reached her district and not her village; starts school in a language nobody speaks at home; her father took a job down the Interoceánica and sends money some months and not others; she sleeps with her mother and siblings in the room where the cooking fire is; she eats lunch at school and, on weekends, at the mothers' common pot. No one barrier decided her life. Together they set the price.",
